This is the fifth and final chapter of the [[I Can't Choose, Eevee]] manga. It was first published on [[Poké Times]] on December 10, 2024 at 8:00 PM JST.<ref>[https://twitter.com/poke_times/status/1866437728151187468 Chapter 5 on Poké Times] (Japanese)</ref> It is 8 pages long.

This is one of three possible endings to the manga. It was determined as the final chapter by the number of reposts the previous chapters received. Specifically, the [[EYE02|second chapter]] garnered more reposts than the [[EYE03|third]] and [[EYE04|fourth]] chapters.

